%%% note
由来: mulet test/mulet/exchange_patterns_test.clj:516 (using-variable-in-map-test)
testing: Variable binding inside map via do block (equivalent to using)
元の形: DW スクリプト
mulet: 成功
%%% script
%dw 2.0
output application/json
---
[{name: "a", price: 10}, {name: "b", price: 20}] map do {
  var item = $
  ---
  {
    label: item.name,
    total: item.price * 2
  }
}
%%% output application/json
[
  {
    "label": "a",
    "total": 20
  },
  {
    "label": "b",
    "total": 40
  }
]
